B.a6q=new A.n(B.ab9,["Mobile App Developer","Freelance","As a freelance mobile app developer, I worked with clients across the Arab world, building custom Flutter apps for various sectors.\n\nNotable projects include:\n\u2022 Ed-Autism (Jordan), an educational app for children with autism.\n\u2022 Manadeb (Saudi Arabia), a delivery management tool with map-based routing.\n\u2022 VitalFit (UAE), a platform for booking sports sessions and viewing coach content.\n\u2022 HelloDr (Iraq), a medical platform with separate apps for patients and doctors.\n\nI also enhanced and maintained several other apps by adding features and fixing bugs.",2024,2023,!0,B.a_r],t.M)
