B.a6G=new A.n(B.ab8,["Web Developer","InSoftOnline - Germany","I worked full-time as a Web Developer and IT Support Specialist, assisting over 50 clients with our POS and sales systems.\n\nI developed and designed more than 15 WordPress websites and handled company-wide technical support.\n\nMy responsibilities included remote IT support via AnyDesk, setting up and maintaining Linux (Ubuntu) servers, designing websites and online stores, and creating a wide range of graphic materials such as logos, brochures, packaging, promotional videos, and social media content.\n\nI also contributed to UI/UX design for mobile and web applications developed by the company.",2020,!1,2022,B.a3S,B.Zn],t.M)
